  "html": "<main id=\"main\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"flex-1 outline-none\"><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-14\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">Bread Classes</h1><div data-slot=\"section-header\" class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 mt-8\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground\">Saturdays</span><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance\">Bread-making at the bakery</h2><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-balance max-w-prose\">A Saturday morning at Harbour Loaf: mix, fold, shape and bake with the same dough that goes on the counter, then take a loaf home.</p></div><div class=\"mt-10 max-w-3xl\"><article data-slot=\"story-lead\" class=\"\"><div data-slot=\"safe-image\" class=\"overflow-hidden bg-muted rounded-lg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:16/9\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Spend a Saturday morning at the bench\" class=\"relative size-full\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(150deg, color-mix(in oklch, var(--primary) 26%, var(--muted)) 0 59%, color-mix(in oklch, var(--accent) 30%, var(--muted)) 59% 75%, color-mix(in oklch, var(--primary) 11%, var(--muted)) 75% 100%)\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"background:repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, color-mix(in oklch, var(--foreground) 6%, transparent) 0 1px, transparent 1px 10px)\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-[5px] rounded-[3px] border border-foreground/10\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-image absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 size-7 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-foreground/30\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"m21 15-3.086-3.086a2 2 0 0 0-2.828 0L6 21\"></path></svg><span class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 line-clamp-2 bg-background/85 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-start text-[11px] font-medium leading-snug text-foreground/80\">Spend a Saturday morning at the bench</span></div></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted-foreground\">At Harbour Loaf</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl\">Spend a Saturday morning at the bench</h2><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Once a week we set a few extra places at the bench and walk a small group through the bake. You work by hand, at the pace of the dough, and leave with a loaf you made.</p></article><p class=\"mt-4\">Classes are for ages 12 and up.</p></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-muted mt-10\" style=\"aspect-ratio:16/9\"><img data-slot=\"photo\" src=\"/u/fold-lane-bakery/8e6bd4818b036cfcd639d1bb5ec6156c.jpg\" alt=\"A sourdough boule cooling after the morning bake\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full object-cover\"></div><div data-slot=\"section-header\" class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 mt-16\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground\">The morning</span><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance\">How a Saturday class runs</h2><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-balance max-w-prose\">From the first mix to a loaf you carry home.</p></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><ol data-slot=\"steps\" class=\"grid gap-6\"><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><span class=\"grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full border text-sm font-medium tabular-nums\">1</span><span class=\"font-medium\">Arrive and meet the starter</span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Saturday morning, before the counter gets busy. Coffee, an apron, and a look at the crock that has been fed since we opened.</span></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><span class=\"grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full border text-sm font-medium tabular-nums\">2</span><span class=\"font-medium\">Mix the dough</span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Stoneground flour, water, salt, and the starter. You mix by hand and learn the feel of a dough that will take a long prove.</span></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><span class=\"grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full border text-sm font-medium tabular-nums\">3</span><span class=\"font-medium\">Fold, shape and score</span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">A few folds as it strengthens, then shape into a boule or batard, rest, and score before it goes in.</span></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><span class=\"grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full border text-sm font-medium tabular-nums\">4</span><span class=\"font-medium\">Bake and take it home</span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Your loaf comes out with the morning bake. Cool it a little at the rack, then carry it home still warm.</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"mt-16\"><section data-slot=\"key-points\" aria-label=\"In short\" class=\"rounded-md border border-border p-4\"><h2 class=\"mb-2 text-sm font-medium\">In short</h2><ul class=\"flex list-disc flex-col gap-1 ps-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground\"><li>Saturday mornings only — the class runs while the bakery is open.</li><li>Small groups, so everyone has space at the bench.</li><li>You take home the loaf you mixed, shaped and baked.</li><li>No experience needed. We work at the pace of the dough.</li></ul></section></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pb-20 motion-reveal\"><section data-slot=\"cta-band\" class=\"rounded-xl border bg-card px-6 py-12 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance\">Come in and ask at the counter</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-2 max-w-xl text-muted-foreground text-balance\">Places are few. Call in on a weekday, or ask when you collect a loaf, and we will tell you the next Saturday that has space.</p><div class=\"mt-6\"><a href=\"/visit\" data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium cursor-pointer transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary text-primary-foreground shadow hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 rounded-md px-8\">How to find us</a></div></section></section></main>",
